。\n- 本地最终`npm run check`106.520秒成功：Vitest1789/46，runtime9491通过/1平台跳过，materials67通过/1平台跳过；类型、构建、数据检查通过，lint0错误23警告。首轮测试路径失败及其原日志保留，未修改产品迁就测试。\n- [精确提交CI39159983288](https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/actions/runs/39159983288) 正在运行；以终态为准。\n\n独立材料、原模型回答、失败日志、冻结复评与业务边界由依赖本PR的[PR #46](https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/46)交付。原v28检查点保留，v29对同一回答另存复评。新材料参考标签仍为非专家暂定，技术通过不等于人工业务验收。没有重新推理、训练、合并本PR或部署生产。\n","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T19:43:35Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"02813ffcd3f83c31e37b414a2f03f07f144cf767","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/45/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/statuses/5374d66748a7c329c4c595ec91372d324edff573","head":{"label":"ZZZZihan:feature/material-facts-v7-guards","ref":"feature/material-facts-v7-guards","sha":"5374d66748a7c329c4c595ec91372d324edff573","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113167863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com